<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Central Fidelity upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Central Fidelity upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson-Humphrey Co Inc said on Friday it had raised its rating for Central Fidelity Banks Inc to long-term buy from long-term market perform.</p>
<p>-- The Atlanta firm also kept Central Fidelity at a near-term market perform.</p>
<p>-- Analyst John Coffey was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares opened unchanged at 26-3/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
